"HELP requests support information. The expected HELP response is:\n      \"Flexible Timers sends account verification codes and reminder SMS you\n      schedule for yourself. Help: https://xintechllc.com/FlexibleTimers/support.html. Reply\n      STOP to opt out.\"" = "HELP ber om informasjon om kundestøtte. Det forventede HELP-svaret er: «Flexible Timers sender bekreftelseskoder for kontoer og SMS-påminnelser som du planlegger for deg selv. Hjelp: https://xintechllc.com/FlexibleTimers/support.html. Svar STOP for å melde deg av.»";
"HELP response: Flexible Timers sends account verification codes and\n      reminder SMS you schedule for yourself. Help:\n      https://xintechllc.com/FlexibleTimers/support.html. Reply STOP to opt out." = "HELP-svar: Flexible Timers sender bekreftelseskoder for kontoer og SMS-påminnelser som du planlegger for deg selv. Hjelp: https://xintechllc.com/FlexibleTimers/support.html. Svar STOP for å melde deg av.";
